From: stecasta
Subject: [PATCH] [Qwen4Exp] NVFP4 PLE tables for host_file_gather

Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59958
Upstream-Commit: 2231f31b6043096595e5070d52a5df2685e3efec
Base-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56273
Base-Commit: 4e0681ed5654c1d8afb3c104d4381afd08529de8
Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58815
Upstream-Commit: a7ebbe5fa1fe5984e4d0f1f2d65ab3501d6ba9ac
Integration-Base: 355553ac22dca4080929ea8f88a446f15df1f3ba

NVFP4 PLE support from #56273 is already in the integration base.
Carry the remaining host-file-gather integration from the recorded PR
snapshots, preserving the existing host_file_gather configuration.
Retain byte-view block scales and file binding with #56273's sentinel-only
scale validation. Preserve #56322's full-token prefetch and sequence
parallelism; replicated file-gather rows are sharded without reduce-scatter.
File-gather implements the current PLE prefetch interface while retaining
synchronous prepare_inputs staging. Construction tests cover all three PLE
formats with dummy, safetensors, and b12x load configurations.

